<title>USA: Cymer files to offer up to 1.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Cymer files to offer up to 1.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cymer Inc said Monday it would file with the Securities and Exchange Commission in early December for a public offering of up to 1.5 million shares.</p>
<p>The company said it will sell up to one million shares and certain shareholders will sell 500,000.</p>
<p>Cymer, which had its initial public offering in September, said it will use its net proceeds to expand manufacturing capacity and for working capital.  </p>
<p>Cymer closed at 34-1/4 Friday.</p>
